post.description:
Upload an initial or replacement kubeconfig; set activate=false to stage it.

Secret metadata and scope are managed internally. The document is write-only;
callers only identify the cluster and receive the new version's safe metadata.

get.description:
Read cached cluster facts or discover live on a miss or cache failure.

Requires instance-owner access. Live fallback is bounded and read-only;
cache failures do not prevent returning fresh partial results.
